Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "FollowVehicleNightRain" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :vehicle1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :rainy1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 .

:vehicle1 a :Vehicle .
:rainy1 a :RainyCondition .

:risk1 a :Rear-EndCollisionRisk ;
    :description "Reduced visibility and wet road surface increasing rear-end collision probability" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 ;
    :confidenceScore "0.85"^^xsd:float .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: Potential for rear-end collision due to limited visibility in rainy, nighttime conditions and wet road surface conditions reducing braking performance.
